    "body": "Closes all holes introduced in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36437 , then adds one more recently developed that involves 2+ honest CPFPs\r\n\r\nThis will stay in draft, with the plan off peeling off fixes for follow-ups to #36437 until no holes remain, or we decide the holes are not worth filling. \r\n\r\nreplaces #36369\r\n\r\nList of known vectors: https://gist.github.com/instagibbs/880a76535fd802fced9f9a5253cdbb40",
